pace remained unchanged.\\\"\\n    reads \\\"6\\\"\\n    writes \\\"1\\\"\\n    incoming_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    outgoing_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    retention_score \\\"7\\\"\\n    qualifiers \\\"conversation_id=issue-716|kind=message|role=user\\\"\\n    validation \\\"aligned\\\"\\n  learned_expression_04\\n    id \\\"observation:client-capability\\\"\\n    text \\\"message\\nuser\\nThe Agent CLI advertised write and shell capabilities but Formal AI returned prose instead of structured tool calls.\\\"\\n    reads \\\"5\\\"\\n    writes \\\"1\\\"\\n    incoming_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    outgoing_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    retention_score \\\"6\\\"\\n    qualifiers \\\"conversation_id=issue-716|kind=message|role=user\\\"\\n    validation \\\"aligned\\\"\\n  learned_expression_05\\n    id \\\"observation:follow-up-source\\\"\\n    text \\\"message\\nuser\\nA follow-up output edit changed presentation without reliably changing the source artifact sent to the client.\\\"\\n    reads \\\"4\\\"\\n    writes \\\"1\\\"\\n    incoming_links \\\"1\\\"\\n    outgoing_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    retention_score \\\"6\\\"\\n    qualifiers \\\"conversation_id=issue-716|kind=message|role=user\\\"\\n    validation \\\"aligned\\\"\\n  learned_expression_06\\n    id \\\"lesson:side-effect-boundary\\\"\\n    text \\\"learning_amendment\\nassistant\\nHTTP planning must emit only advertised client capabilities; embedded execution remains restricted to explicitly local isolated surfaces.\\nlesson:typed-execution-artifact\\\"\\n    reads \\\"0\\\"\\n    writes \\\"3\\\"\\n    incoming_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    outgoing_links \\\"1\\\"\\n    retention_score \\\"4\\\"\\n    qualifiers \\\"conversation_id=issue-716|kind=learning_amendment|role=assistant\\\"\\n    validation \\\"aligned\\\"\\n  learned_expression_07\\n    id \\\"lesson:presentation-independence\\\"\\n    text \\\"learning_amendment\\nassistant\\nHuman-facing wording and localization may change without altering executable intent because protocol adapte